U3GS6ZBhkaEu4Azj4h1orHQA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afth_bb9ofj2G81GTS9Vm9o-ucgBvr--Xr6GfpCj6B3Enw&oe=69A83142"}, "display_name": "Meep The Foundation", "keywords": ["Meep", "Horror", "Multiplayer", "Game", "Scary"], "long_description": "Meep\n\nI don\u2019t really know how to explain it.\nIt starts out normal \u2014 just some friends messing around, climbing stuff, playing tag like in Gorilla Tag. But then it\u2026 changes.\n\nThe maps feel wrong. The sounds don\u2019t match what you see. Sometimes you hear breathing, even when no one's near you.\nWe thought it was a bug until one of us went missing.\n\nIf you play long enough, things start showing up.\nStuff moves on its own.\nVoices echo weird.\nSometimes you spawn in alone even when you're not supposed to.\n\nWe tried to delete it, but it keeps coming back.\nJust don\u2019t play it alone.\nAnd if something tags you \u2014 don\u2019t let it stay tagged for long.", "short_description": "Get Ready Because The Horrors Of Meep Have Arrived"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/meepthefoundation", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BloopVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/meepweb/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24848916691377941"}